[2026-11-27T11:42:13Z] note: setup: universe DBC,EEM,EFA,GLD,IEF,SPY,TLT,VNQ as ONE month-end portfolio; Yahoo daily adjusted; IS 2004-01-01 -> 2016-01-01, OOS -> 2026-11-23 (frozen); 10,000 USD sleeve, 100 % split by target weights; fee 0.05 % + slippage 0.03 % per fill.
[2026-11-27T11:42:13Z] note: assumptions: n is the SMA length; the volatility window stays 63. | point-in-time universe: a member joins once it is listed and its indicators exist; before that it is not part of the ranking (same as breadth_scaled_sector_allocation). EXECUTION.md's 'skip the rebalance if a member lacks history' would otherwise move the start to the youngest ETF's listing (XLC 2018, DBC 2006). | cash earns 0 %: EXECUTION.md allows this only as the labelled conservative scenario; none of these rules needs a cash yield (no excess-cash momentum), so ^IRX isn't used. | costs: library convention (ETFs fee 0.05 % + slippage 0.03 % per fill; crypto 0.10 % + 0.10 %), same as the other library runs, so leaderboard entries compare. | Yahoo adjusted closes (dividends reinvested) serve as both the signal (total-return) and the fill series, like every other library run; EXECUTION.md's separate raw execution series isn't available. | participation cap (1 % of volume) not modelled: a 10k sleeve in liquid ETFs/coins never reaches it. | every month-end decision restores the target weights, trimming drift too; trims keep the holding's cost basis, stop and age, and don't close a trade (a trade = first buy to full exit).
[2026-11-27T11:42:13Z] note: backtest.py adapted from template: built by scripts/portfolio_lib/build.py = this spec's target_weights() + shared month-end portfolio simulator (generalized from breadth_scaled_sector_allocation's _simulate_portfolio: EXECUTION.md sells-first rebalance, no-loosen hard stop, max_candles age, skip rebalance on a missing member bar) + the template's generic machinery. run() simulates the symbol list as one portfolio.
[2026-11-27T11:42:13Z] note: sanity check: spec defaults IS: 106 trades, 6.13 %/yr, max DD -14.09 % (OOS 111 trades, 4.93 %/yr, DD -27.96 %). Verified on generated trades/weights: decisions only on month-end bars, fills at the next open; a time-exited or stopped holding returns only at a later month-end; rebalance sells before buying. Shared solvers checked on 300 random covariances (min-variance never worse than 20k random long-only portfolios; ERC contributions equal within 1e-6). dual_momentum spot check 2007-12-31: IEF ROC 10.3 % > EFA 9.8 % -> switched to IEF.
